{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Drako, a little vampire cat with a big score to settle. Sent to jail for freeing the city\u2019s blood supply, Drako meets a mysterious friend who tasks him with the heist of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/53b665053c20c8dcc1489268ca18ec0f.avif?t=1762328295\" width=830 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/84ee53111da94c376eb26d076f77b9ce.poster.avif?t=1762328295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/84ee53111da94c376eb26d076f77b9ce.webm?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/84ee53111da94c376eb26d076f77b9ce.mp4?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack into mainframe security and bust your way into the city\u2019s blood banks. Successful hacking causes bank bots to malfunction. Use this to your advantage and even the field against your robo foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/37a76583340f6c1a4834ed3170eeb745.avif?t=1762328295\" width=830 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/bcebbed72ca1045f03798c4c64967b29.poster.avif?t=1762328295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/bcebbed72ca1045f03798c4c64967b29.webm?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/bcebbed72ca1045f03798c4c64967b29.mp4?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up powerful weapon mods and equip them in your hideout. Switch up your equipped mods and find the perfect loadout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/0d3830a5dc7ac1c672f445b4c74d4e43.avif?t=1762328295\" width=830 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/8a9e4364fd2853b45ea14228d45f827b.poster.avif?t=1762328295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/8a9e4364fd2853b45ea14228d45f827b.webm?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/8a9e4364fd2853b45ea14228d45f827b.mp4?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect seeds on your heist runs and take them back to your hideout. Plant, water and grow them into little demon sidekicks - tenacious garlic, catnip bombs, portal weavers and fiery friends await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/c9570ea733c7506922b80efe0cb480db.avif?t=1762328295\" width=830 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/85b14d5d093392f18c59e86c3ec60888.poster.avif?t=1762328295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/85b14d5d093392f18c59e86c3ec60888.webm?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/85b14d5d093392f18c59e86c3ec60888.mp4?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on increasingly fearsome enemies, with every run different from the last. Death will boot you back to your hideout, but you\u2019ll hold on to any unlocked mods, hack tools and seeds. Ready for just One. More. Run?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104790?t=1762328295","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104790?t=1762328295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/6c01d4458c4ca833090d443791c9082b0cccbd4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762328295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/6c01d4458c4ca833090d443791c9082b0cccbd4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762328295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains cartoon/fantasy violence and may not be suitable for all ages. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Drako, a little vampire cat with a big score to settle. Sent to jail for freeing the city\u2019s blood supply, Drako meets a mysterious friend who tasks him with the heist of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/53b665053c20c8dcc1489268ca18ec0f.avif?t=1762328295\" width=830 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/84ee53111da94c376eb26d076f77b9ce.poster.avif?t=1762328295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/84ee53111da94c376eb26d076f77b9ce.webm?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/84ee53111da94c376eb26d076f77b9ce.mp4?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack into mainframe security and bust your way into the city\u2019s blood banks. Successful hacking causes bank bots to malfunction. Use this to your advantage and even the field against your robo foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/37a76583340f6c1a4834ed3170eeb745.avif?t=1762328295\" width=830 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat