/c9570ea733c7506922b80efe0cb480db.avif?t=1762328295\" width=830 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/85b14d5d093392f18c59e86c3ec60888.poster.avif?t=1762328295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/85b14d5d093392f18c59e86c3ec60888.webm?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/extras/85b14d5d093392f18c59e86c3ec60888.mp4?t=1762328295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on increasingly fearsome enemies, with every run different from the last. Death will boot you back to your hideout, but you\u2019ll hold on to any unlocked mods, hack tools and seeds. Ready for just One. More. Run?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Standoff Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104790/335cbb744461970366c8e48be695cdd38cf92244/header.jpg?t=1762328295","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104790/1114334093/a830e672adb6e3f18519d6ebd683355a0ac69e86/1760200579/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761908594","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104790/1114334093/a830e672adb6e3f18519d6ebd683355a0ac69e86/1760200579/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761908594","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104790/1114334093/a830e672adb6e3f18519d6ebd683355a0ac69e86/1760200579/hls_